[Default Config](https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/default_config/) Version: {default_config_version}
Included Integrations: {total_integrations}

Default Config Manager allows you to manage default_config components without sacrificing automatic updates. It uses the built-in component list and preserves the native start-up mechanism, ensuring components load as intended.

Use Advanced Mode to disable individual components.
